<title>USA: U.S. stockpile rejects nickel bids.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile rejects nickel bids.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it rejected the nickel offers made by six companies.</p>
<p>The lowest bid was at $2.57 per pound by C R Supply Co for 250,000 pounds, and the highest bid was at $2.99 per pound by S Wilkoff &amp; Sons for 80,000 pounds.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
